{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0703_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0703_1000_p", "source_sha256": "ef5b0eb37326a93eb90ea8420850b744cb2d98cac1c9c68813bb300cf5fc2d1a", "ja": "（今日は公演用の撮影と取材が入っている。\nちょっと忙しい二本立てのスケジュールだ）", "zh": "（今天有公演相关的拍摄和采访。是个稍微有点忙的双重安排呢。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0703_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0703_1001_p", "source_sha256": "675f077ccb1bc221a15de8c6d9148fa50a801101a8e226d3ebf65a104f9347e0", "ja": "（これからティザー用に歌っているシーンを撮影し、\n終わった後にインタビューだけど、千早は……）", "zh": "（接下来要拍摄预告片中唱歌的场景，拍完之后还要采访，不过千早她……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0703_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0703_1003_002chi", "source_sha256": "336cb21e16852ff2d2610d5eab1b2c16c0fff8b5f7184518ac0cf042817940bb", "ja": "コンディションは整えてきました。\n……いつでもいけます。", "zh": "状态已经调整好了。\n……随时可以开始。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0703_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0703_1004_p", "source_sha256": "5fd5e34a0867f9eebd0100e4da3bddd006ca46b960840a149f667c5922f86b1d", "ja": "最高に集中できてるな。\nよし！　じゃあそろそろ歌を……、うん？", "zh": "现在的专注度达到了最佳状态。\n好！那差不多该开始唱……，嗯？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0703_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0703_1005_staff", "source_sha256": "0fe19c8d700e8eba5237a9033b7036bacded08fe96c4bbf312cea2a60e091b51", "ja": "765プロさん、すみません！　機材トラブルで\nセッティングにまだ時間がかかりそうで……！", "zh": "765PRO的各位，不好意思！因为器材故障，\n布置调整好像还要花些时间……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0703_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0703_1006_staff", "source_sha256": "d1e748683eca6acee263a10841a631ed6e7bccfb0411b0208a2069135617d209", "ja": "大変申し訳ないんですけど、\nインタビューを先にお願いできませんか？", "zh": "实在非常抱歉，\n能麻烦您先接受采访吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0703_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0703_1007_p", "source_sha256": "89b876888bef1b723bc38497dc720836c4b2b34dcac2c3f881d53e0270c0e365", "ja": "そ……そうですか。\nもちろん、待つだけなら問題ないんですが……。", "zh": "那……这样啊。  \n当然，只是等一等的话倒是没问题……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0703_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0703_1008_002chi", "source_sha256": "1c66ecfcde25bd5149e9c80854233973221b40d7c10548beb3e24851202bd85e", "ja": "……、わかりました。\nでは、先にインタビューを。", "zh": "……我明白了。\n那就先进行采访吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0703_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0703_1009_staff", "source_sha256": "20fb69fd39649a364442939ea0da66fe4a327545eb26fc34cac225905161b1da", "ja": "ありがとうございます、助かります！\n急いで準備しますので、もう少しお待ちください！", "zh": "谢谢，帮大忙了！\n我马上准备，请再稍等一会儿！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0703_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0703_1010_se", "source_sha256": "6067586b6ee6ba9da8eec9ea2b642802924e13930c1f7af264199c4b54c7698d", "ja": "バタバタバタ……！", "zh": "啪嗒啪嗒啪嗒……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0703_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0703_1011_p", "source_sha256": "35e122027c9233624716d303d1eedbc84e5b4fa4dcf22c50f4ea47a2a55f58d5", "ja": "……残念だな。\n歌うには最高の状態に持ってきてたのに。", "zh": "……真遗憾。\n明明已经调整到最适合演唱的最佳状态了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0703_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0703_1012_002chi", "source_sha256": "05a88587f4fea4b10559f2f6725b9f06642bbe659313946656ea39ab9924d276", "ja": "トラブルは仕方ありません。よくあること……。\n大丈夫、合わせます。", "zh": "突发状况也是没办法的事。这种情况很常见……\n没关系，我会配合你的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0703_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0703_1013_002chi", "source_sha256": "1bfbcc13eca3c071d60a2bc9e52a0465ebfa9cf84641fb80b7928a6625ea9dc7", "ja": "あ……、もしかして、心配ですか？", "zh": "啊……难道说，你在担心吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0703_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0703_1014_p", "source_sha256": "24bc7bc2ba219da7d324cfb5811b2b8e261fc5786b724a7edf0512b18c114176", "ja": "いや、全然。\n千早なら大丈夫って、安心してる。", "zh": "不，完全没有。\n因为是千早，所以很放心，觉得肯定没问题的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0703_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0703_1015_002chi", "source_sha256": "1d48cf838414d7077ad767e10fb85807913bff0894b34db37180257377b99ce5", "ja": "そ、そうですか。\nあまり簡単そうに言われると、少し複雑ですが……。", "zh": "这、这样啊。\n被说得好像很简单一样，感觉有点复杂……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0703_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0703_1016_002chi", "source_sha256": "ccad0ea0a3d3caddaced98b7746f7c4b1e606d0deb3f997814456fb962ae97ff", "ja": "信頼されていると、受け取っておきます。", "zh": "我就当作这是对我的信任吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0703_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0703_1017_p", "source_sha256": "90cc20e7cc104e5266841456674a07baafd878636b22335d326c77018ddfa43b", "ja": "うん、信頼してるし、期待してるんだ。\n新人の頃なら、話は別だけど。", "zh": "嗯，我相信你，也对你抱有期待。\n要是刚当新人的时候，那就另当别论了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0703_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0703_1018_002chi", "source_sha256": "a4ed0a4473518a7be611b6dcc77365557ad29f7d5466ca59ec14f537abd194cc", "ja": "そうですね。あの頃は、歌以外のことを考える余裕……\nというか、意思が……あまりなかったと思います。", "zh": "是啊。那时候，连考虑唱歌以外事情的余裕……不，应该说，意愿……我觉得都不太有。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0703_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0703_1019_002chi", "source_sha256": "f635238e02c33ddf9258de15582ba28f607efa9b3b0378ac7bd9b2b4366c4c44", "ja": "でも{$P$}に、いろいろなことを経験\nさせてもらったので……本当に、いろいろなことを。", "zh": "但是，多亏{$P$}让我经历了各种各样的事情……真的，经历了很多。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0703_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0703_1020_p", "source_sha256": "6c26cdfe77e41ee923bca1fb7e0b988fcdc2550d9c7f4221616a16ae0877ab77", "ja": "それは……お礼なのか、それとも苦情かな？", "zh": "那是……在道谢，还是在抱怨呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0703_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0703_1021_002chi", "source_sha256": "af7dc4c10493a18cbda2bcf8104191c980bb11365f84b682b09faba75b01f9bb", "ja": "ふふっ、どちらでしょう。\nご自分で考えてください。", "zh": "呵呵，到底是哪一个呢。\n请您自己想想吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0703_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0703_1022_002chi", "source_sha256": "c66034af1134b6512ee995a948f5f4c4bd09077e694f3bff1375f62470d12a23", "ja": "あ……いけない。{$P$}、\n大丈夫じゃないことがありました。", "zh": "啊……糟了。{$P$}，\n有件事不太妙。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0703_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0703_1023_p", "source_sha256": "917df3d12cb4048490f614b9e7363f8598a144404a351cd03161165e7518cd86", "ja": "えっ、撮影のことで？", "zh": "咦，是拍摄的事吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0703_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0703_1024_002chi", "source_sha256": "243630bd95716dd1fd54bd74659331b368aced2840c04e93170ff50b38df2f5d", "ja": "いえ、その前になったインタビューです。\n何を話すか、一緒に考えてもらえますか？", "zh": "不，是改到了拍摄前面的采访。\n能和我一起想想该聊些什么吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0703_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0703_1025_002chi", "source_sha256": "8f1b641cdbb33a80ab75d00e5af7feaa22489ff92aa9295aeaf928e7b7a72836", "ja": "撮影の感想を話すつもりだったのですが、\n使えなくなってしまったので……。", "zh": "本来打算谈谈拍摄的感想，可是因为已经用不了了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0703_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0703_1026_p", "source_sha256": "7cef8a9e51f84feac7954660fcdfb80773a891f561f3b9339088c168866113cb", "ja": "ああ、なるほど。よし、任せてくれ！\nえーと、最初はどんな流れだっけ。", "zh": "啊，原来如此。好，交给我吧！\n呃，最开始的流程是什么来着？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_episode_002chi0703_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_002chi0703_1027_p", "source_sha256": "74c362abd0ddd5a4ed5b966dd4f7062eca0630dce0a09c70d7ffcc315a879ea5", "ja": "（千早は着実に前に進んでいる。\nこれからも隣を歩いて、見守り、支えていこう）", "zh": "（千早正在稳步前进。今后也要继续陪她一起走下去，守望着她，支持着她。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
